  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Radix -- asset-centric blockchain built for DeFi with Cerberus BFT consensus, Radix Engine v2, and native asset types that eliminate common smart contract vulnerabilities. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and resources. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
